211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (How do you teach people to read and write if they can't speak or understand English? The presenter will share tips, techniques, and lesson plans. One of the key components of success is building a class community where the students get to know, help, trust, and respect one another. Attendees will leave this session with an understanding of the process and a variety of techniques and activities they can use in their own beginner level classes.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
