/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In this interactive workshop, the presenters will share strategies and activities that build and strengthen classroom community in both face-to-face and online classes. Building community among beginning-level students presents unique challenges. However, it can be accomplished using simple interactive activities that have strong vocabulary and grammar support. The presenters will demonstrate a variety of student-approved techniques and activities designed to boost peer engagement in listening, speaking, reading, and writing lessons. Participants are invited to share strategies and activities that have proven successful in their own classrooms, leaving with a collection of lesson materials, games, and activities ready-to-use in upcoming classes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
