228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Strategies for Engaging Students in Financial Literacy and Language Development)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This workshop offers dynamic approaches to engage English Language Learners in both language development and financial literacy. Workshop participants will explore a comprehensive program designed to immerse students in real-world finance, foster research skills, encourage critical thinking, and enhance language proficiency. The benefits of this course reaches beyond language and financial literacy, touching on the promotion of long-term financial planning, career opportunities, and a perspective on global economic systems. By the end, workshop participants will be well-equipped to implement this innovative approach to empower their students to navigate the intricacies of the global economy and express themselves confidently in English.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
