239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In today's digital age, artificial intelligence \(AI\) has emerged as a powerful tool with the potential to revolutionize education. Our workshop, "The Impact of ChatGPT and Wordtune Integration in our Classrooms," offers a comprehensive exploration of how AI, specifically ChatGPT and Wordtune can be integrated into English as a Second Language \(ESL\) and English Language Arts \(ELA\) classrooms, with a primary focus on enhancing students' writing skills.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
