275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Allison Walter, M.A. Ph.D., has been teaching English and French for over 3 decades. However, her experience goes beyond teaching, spanning a variety of topics, such as filmmaking, and small business creation. She has worked in localizing and distributing video games, and has written and produced short and feature films. For her films, Allison has also worked as a social media manager, creating and managing advertising campaigns on various platforms. She has presented at conferences on various topics of French literature and philosophy as well as giving workshops on class management and the American school system. Allison has presented at past CATESOL conferences: a joint workshop with Kevin Keating on Seven Getting-To-Know Activities \(Los Angeles, 2013\) and Canvas \(CATESOL San Diego, 2019\). )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
>>
