279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Mariana Silva \(she/her\), tenured ESL faculty, has been teaching adult ESL learners at MiraCosta College, California for over ten years. Mariana has taken various classes from @ONE, has taught hybrid courses, and continuously strives to become a better online educator. Mariana is highly committed to equity, inclusion and humanizing her online courses. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
