284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Yassin Hennawy holds a Master's degree in English with a focus on English literature \( Arizona State University\), complemented by ongoing studies as a graduate student at San Diego State University General Linguistics. With a wealth of credentials including the esteemed Cambridge DELTA and CELTA certifications, he possesses a profound understanding of English language teaching methodologies. His expertise extends to neurolanguage coaching, recognized through certification in this innovative approach. A testament to his dedication and skill, he was honored with the Global Teacher Award in 2021. As a certified teacher trainer and curriculum designer, he shapes educational landscapes, fostering effective learning environments. His commitment to excellence in language education is evident in both his academic achievements and professional accolades, positioning him as a respected authority in the field. He is experienced in Teaching ELA & ESL.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
